 ies & vendors: 12:00 PM Kick-off: 4:00 PM More Info & RSVP Game 2: Japan v
 s. Tunisia Saturday June 20 / Sunday June 21\, 2026 Activities & vendors: 
 9:00 PM (June 20) Kick-off: 12:00 AM (MIDNIGHT June 21) More Info & RSVP G
